id: super-saiyan-1-golden-power
name: Golden Power
order: 2
slot: trait
description: >
  Your energy spikes and flows off of you in waves, shining gold with power.
text: >
  Golden Power: Your energy spikes and flows off of you in waves, shining gold with power.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score for your Duel Clashes by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you are hit by an Attacking Maneuver while below the Bruised Health Threshold, reduce the Damage Category of that Attacking Maneuver (for your Damage Calculation) by 1 Category.
  (3)-[Triggered/Transform]: Enter the Raging State until the end of your turn.
  (4)-[Triggered/Transform, 1/Encounter]: Use a Ki Surge.

---

# (1) Duel Clashes 1(T), (2) the Damage Category below Bruised: the table's.

# (3) Entering it: Raging till the end of your turn.
[triggered/transform, effect 3]
enterState(raging, 1, turn);

# (4) Entering it, once an Encounter: a Ki Surge.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, effect 4]
surge(ki);
